      "decision": "White-light spectrum continuous; seven labels conventional. Ordinary glass visible red least/violet most deviation. No claim all RGB mixtures cover every visible color, or pure red object reflects only one exact wavelength. Digital lab§55 uses normal-based angles and coplanarity;§56 controls geometry/material/screen, does not infer universal linear dependence on base width. Supplied hypothetical measurements do not assert empirical experiment completion."
    }
